  m_text: "Compound Assignments:\n\n+= (Add and assign)x += 5; \n// Equivalent to
    x = x + 5;\n\n-= (Subtract and assign)x -= 3; \n// Equivalent to x = x - 3;\n\n*=
    (Multiply and assign), /= (Divide and assign), %= (Modulus and assign) \u2014
    each one combines an arithmetic operation with assignment."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
